-/* ---- Two registers and a scalar ----
- *
- *   1111 001Q 1 D size Vn Vd A(4) N 1 M 0 Vm
- *
- * Vm names the scalar: D0-D7 and a two-bit index for 16-bit elements,
- * D0-D15 and a one-bit index for 32-bit ones. */
